        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>2. Acquire parts and prototype</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 12px 18px;\n    font-family: \"Calibri\", \"Segoe UI\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #000;\n    width: 1024px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-weight: 300;\n    font-size: 42px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 4px 0 10px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  .slide-body {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n  /* ---------- Left text column ---------- */\n  .left-col {\n    width: 385px;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n  }\n  .left-col ul {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding-left: 20px;\n    list-style-type: disc;\n  }\n  .left-col > ul > li {\n    margin-bottom: 7px;\n    font-size: 16.5px;\n  }\n  .left-col > ul > li:first-child {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .left-col ul ul {\n    padding-left: 22px;\n    margin-top: 3px;\n  }\n  .left-col ul ul > li {\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .left-col ul ul ul > li {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n  }\n  .footnote {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin-top: 12px;\n    margin-left: 6px;\n  }\n  /* ---------- Middle diagram column ---------- */\n  .mid-col {\n    width: 330px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px solid #bbb;\n    background: #fafafa;\n    color: #555;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 4px;\n  }\n  .ph-555 {\n    width: 320px;\n    height: 300px;\n    margin: 0 auto 10px auto;\n  }\n  .callout {\n    border: 1px solid #000;\n    width: 195px;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    padding: 4px 6px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    display: inline-block;\n    vertical-align: top;\n  }\n  .lower-mid {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n  .ph-led {\n    width: 105px;\n    height: 305px;\n  }\n  /* ---------- Right flowchart column ---------- */\n  .right-col {\n    width: 270px;\n    position: relative;\n    padding-top: 22px;\n  }\n  .step {\n    border: 1px solid #7ba428;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    padding: 7px 10px;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  .step.active {\n    background: #ed8b32;\n    border-color: #ed8b32;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  .step.bold { font-weight: bold; }\n  .arrow {\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #5b9bd5;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    margin: 3px 0;\n  }\n  .ph-arrows {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: -46px;\n    top: 130px;\n    width: 44px;\n    height: 240px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */\n  .footer {\n    position: relative;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .page-num {\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #555;\n    margin-right: 60px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<h1>2. Acquire parts and prototype</h1>\n\n<div class=\"slide-body\">\n\n  <!-- ================= LEFT COLUMN ================= -->\n  <div class=\"left-col\">\n    <ul>\n      <li>Consult data sheets to understand part selection choices</li>\n      <li>Logic Components\n        <ul>\n          <li>Texas Instruments TLC555 timer</li>\n          <li>Switch (C1 selection)</li>\n          <li>C1: 33uF/100uF capacitor</li>\n          <li>R1: 4.7kohm resistor</li>\n          <li>R2: 10k potentiometer</li>\n          <li>2x 0.1uF decouple capacitors\n            <ul>\n              <li>Required according to TLC555 data sheet</li>\n            </ul>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li>Output components\n        <ul>\n          <li>5mm 20mA Red LED</li>\n          <li>100ohm current limiting resistor for LED</li>\n          <li>ON Semiconductor P2N2222A NPN Transistor</li>\n          <li>1k ohm base resistor</li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li>Power components\n        <ul>\n          <li>2x CR2032 battery holders</li>\n          <li>Micro-USB female connector</li>\n          <li>3.3V low-dropout TC1262 regulator</li>\n          <li>Diodes for battery protection</li>\n          <li>1uF output decouple capacitor\n            <ul>\n              <li>Required according to TC1262 datasheet</li>\n            </ul>\n          </li>\n          <li>Switch to ON/OFF circuit</li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n    <div class=\"footnote\">*Quantity of 1 unless otherwise stated</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ================= MIDDLE COLUMN ================= -->\n  <div class=\"mid-col\">\n    <figure class=\"placeholder ph-555\" style=\"margin-top:0;\">\n      [Schematic diagram: LM555 astable timer circuit, top-center. Labels visible: \"+5V TO +15V\", \"+V<sub>CC</sub>\", \"RESET\", \"TRIGGER\", \"R1\", \"R2\", \"DISCHARGE\", \"LM555\", \"THRESHOLD\", \"CONTROL VOLTAGE\", \"OUTPUT\", \"LOAD\", \"C1\", \"0.01&micro;F\", pins 2, 4, 8, 7, 6, 3, 1, 5]\n    </figure>\n\n    <div class=\"lower-mid\">\n      <div class=\"callout\">\n        TLC555 cannot source high currents so we use a transistor to control the LED.\n      </div>\n      <figure class=\"placeholder ph-led\">\n        [Schematic: LED driver with NPN transistor, right of callout. Labels: \"VCC\", \"GND\", resistor, LED, base resistor]\n      </figure>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ================= RIGHT COLUMN ================= -->\n  <div class=\"right-col\">\n    <div class=\"step\">1. Establish project requirements</div>\n    <div class=\"arrow\">&#11015;</div>\n    <div class=\"step active\">2. Acquire parts and prototype</div>\n    <div class=\"arrow\">&#11015;</div>\n    <div class=\"step bold\">3. Design your PCB schematic</div>\n    <div class=\"arrow\">&#11015;</div>\n    <div class=\"step\">4. Run electrical rule check (ERC).</div>\n    <div class=\"arrow\">&#11015;</div>\n    <div class=\"step bold\">5. Design board: place parts &amp; wiring</div>\n    <div class=\"arrow\">&#11015;</div>\n    <div class=\"step\">6. Setup/run design rule check (DRC)</div>\n    <div class=\"arrow\">&#11015;</div>\n    <div class=\"step\">7. Do 3D rendering</div>\n    <div class=\"arrow\">&#11015;</div>\n    <div class=\"step\">8. Use CAM file to generate Gerbers</div>\n    <div class=\"arrow\">&#11015;</div>\n    <div class=\"step\">9. Zip up relevant Gerber files</div>\n    <div class=\"arrow\">&#11015;</div>\n    <div class=\"step\">10. Set PCB fabrication settings</div>\n    <div class=\"arrow\">&#11015;</div>\n    <div class=\"step\">11. Write out bill of materials (BOM)</div>\n    <div class=\"arrow\">&#11015;</div>\n    <div class=\"step\">12. PCB Assembly</div>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder ph-arrows\">[Red curved loop-back arrows: right margin]</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"page-num\">13</div>\n<div class=\"footer\">Reference: http://www.circuitbasics.com/555-timer-basics-astable-mode/</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
